  "solution": {
    "text": "$y^{2}+4 x+4 y+k=0$ $y^{2}+2 \\times 2 y+4-4+4 x+k=0$\r\n$(y+2)^{2}=-4 x-k+4$\r\n$(y+2)^{2}=-4\\left(x-\\frac{4+k}{4}\\right)$\r\n$\\therefore$ Latusrectum $=4$ units"
  }
